msgid "计算器"
msgstr "Calculator"

msgid ""
"启动命令为 ``calc``，桌面入口仍归属“工具”，不属于 ReliefOffice。 界面使用项目公共 FLTK gtk+ "
"主题、中文字体和系统剪贴板。"
msgstr ""
"Launch with ``calc``. Its desktop entry remains under Tools, outside "
"ReliefOffice. The interface uses the project's shared FLTK gtk+ theme, "
"Chinese fonts, and system clipboard."

msgid "模式"
msgstr "Modes"

msgid "模式：标准; 功能：小数、四则运算、括号、百分比、平方、平方根、倒数、正负号和内存。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Standard; Features: decimals, basic arithmetic, parentheses, "
"percentages, squares, square roots, reciprocals, sign changes, and memory."

msgid "模式：科学; 功能：乘方、阶乘、三角与反三角函数、双曲函数、对数、指数、取整、常量和角度/弧度。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Scientific; Features: powers, factorials, trigonometric and inverse "
"trigonometric functions, hyperbolic functions, logarithms, exponentials, "
"rounding, constants, and degrees/radians."

msgid "模式：程序员; 功能：二、八、十、十六进制；8/16/32/64 位；补码、位运算、移位、循环移位和可点击位编辑器。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Programmer; Features: binary, octal, decimal, and hexadecimal; "
"8/16/32/64-bit words; two's complement, bitwise operations, shifts, rotates,"
" and a clickable bit editor."

msgid "模式：单位换算; 功能：18 类、145 个单位；支持表达式输入、延迟合并的实时预览、交换单位和同时显示其他等价值。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Unit Conversion; Features: 18 categories and 145 units, expression "
"input, debounced live previews, swapping units, and simultaneous display of "
"other equivalents."

msgid "模式：统计; 功能：最多 1024 个数的个数、总和、平均值、中位数、最小/最大值、总体/样本方差及标准差。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Statistics; Features: count, sum, mean, median, minimum/maximum, "
"population/sample variance, and standard deviation for up to 1024 values."

msgid "模式：日期; 功能：公历日期差、周一至周五的工作日数、增加/减少整日，以及星期显示。"
msgstr ""
"Mode: Date; Features: Gregorian date differences, Monday–Friday workday "
"counts, adding/subtracting whole days, and weekday display."

msgid ""
"各模式保留独立输入。历史最多保存本次运行的 64 条结果；内存和历史不写入磁盘。 双击标准/科学模式的历史重新载入表达式并计算；双击其他记录复制其结果。"
msgstr ""
"Each mode retains its own input. History keeps at most 64 results from the "
"current run; memory and history are not written to disk. Double-click "
"Standard/Scientific history to reload and evaluate the expression; double-"
"click other records to copy their results."

msgid "表达式和精度"
msgstr "Expressions and Precision"

msgid "标准与科学模式使用有限双精度浮点数，显示最多 15 位有效数字。 浮点结果存在舍入误差。整数的精确位运算应使用程序员模式。"
msgstr ""
"Standard and Scientific modes use finite double-precision floating-point "
"numbers and display up to 15 significant digits. Floating-point results have"
" rounding errors. Use Programmer mode for exact integer bitwise operations."

msgid "支持 ``+ - * / ^``、括号，以及后缀 ``%``、``!``。"
msgstr "Supports ``+ - * / ^``, parentheses, and postfix ``%`` and ``!``."

msgid "``200*10%`` 等于 ``20``；``200+10%`` 等于 ``200.1``，百分号总是将前面的数除以 100。"
msgstr ""
"``200*10%`` equals ``20``; ``200+10%`` equals ``200.1``. Percent always "
"divides the preceding number by 100."

msgid "乘方从右向左结合：``2^3^2 = 512``；``-2^2 = -4``；``2^-3 = 0.125``。"
msgstr ""
"Exponentiation is right-associative: ``2^3^2 = 512``; ``-2^2 = -4``; ``2^-3 "
"= 0.125``."

msgid "乘法必须写出 ``*``，例如 ``2*pi``。"
msgstr "Multiplication requires an explicit ``*``, for example ``2*pi``."

msgid "常量为 ``pi``、``tau``、``e``，``ans`` 为最后一个标准/科学计算结果，``mem`` 为内存值。"
msgstr ""
"Constants are ``pi``, ``tau``, and ``e``; ``ans`` is the last "
"Standard/Scientific result, and ``mem`` is the memory value."

msgid ""
"单参数函数：``sin cos tan asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh sqrt cbrt ln log exp abs "
"floor ceil round``。"
msgstr ""
"Single-argument functions: ``sin cos tan asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh sqrt "
"cbrt ln log exp abs floor ceil round``."

msgid "双参数函数：``pow min max hypot mod atan2``，以逗号分隔两个参数；``atan2(y,x)``。"
msgstr ""
"Two-argument functions: ``pow min max hypot mod atan2``, with arguments "
"separated by a comma; ``atan2(y,x)``."

msgid "三角函数和反三角函数受角度/弧度选择影响，双曲函数不受影响。"
msgstr ""
"Degrees/radians affect trigonometric and inverse trigonometric functions, "
"but not hyperbolic functions."

msgid "阶乘只接受 0 至 170 的整数；除零、无效定义域和非有限结果均显示明确错误。"
msgstr ""
"Factorial accepts only integers from 0 to 170. Division by zero, invalid "
"domains, and nonfinite results show explicit errors."

msgid "表达式最多 1024 字节，嵌套/一元运算深度有界，不执行脚本或外部命令。"
msgstr ""
"Expressions are limited to 1024 bytes, with bounded nesting/unary-operation "
"depth. Scripts and external commands are not executed."

msgid ""
"内存按钮为 ``MC`` （清除）、 ``MR`` （读取）、 ``MS`` （存储）、 ``M+`` （加）、 ``M-`` （减）。 "
"存储和加减使用当前有效表达式；失败时保留原内存值。 计算后继续输入运算符会接着当前结果计算，输入数字开始新表达式；``=`` 和 ``Enter`` "
"均可求值。多行统计输入区的 ``Ctrl+Enter`` 在原生输入控件之前处理。"
msgstr ""
"Memory buttons are ``MC`` (clear), ``MR`` (recall), ``MS`` (store), ``M+`` "
"(add), and ``M-`` (subtract). Store and add/subtract use the current valid "
"expression; failure preserves the old memory value. After evaluation, typing"
" an operator continues from the result, while typing a digit starts a new "
"expression. Both ``=`` and ``Enter`` evaluate. ``Ctrl+Enter`` in multiline "
"statistics input is handled before the native input widget."

msgid "程序员模式"
msgstr "Programmer Mode"

msgid ""
"未带前缀的数字按所选进制解释；``0x``、``0b``、``0o``、``0d`` 分别显式指定 十六、二、八、十进制。例如 "
"``0xFF+0b1010`` 等于十进制 ``265``。 数字不经过浮点数，因此可以精确处理 ``18446744073709551615``。"
msgstr ""
"Numbers without prefixes use the selected base. ``0x``, ``0b``, ``0o``, and "
"``0d`` explicitly specify hexadecimal, binary, octal, and decimal. For "
"example, ``0xFF+0b1010`` equals decimal ``265``. Numbers never pass through "
"floating-point representation, allowing exact handling of "
"``18446744073709551615``."

msgid "运算优先级从低到高为："
msgstr "Operator precedence, from lowest to highest:"

msgid "``OR`` / ``|``"
msgstr "``OR`` / ``|``"

msgid "``XOR`` / ``^``"
msgstr "``XOR`` / ``^``"

msgid "``AND`` / ``&``"
msgstr "``AND`` / ``&``"

msgid "``<<``、``>>``"
msgstr "``<<``, ``>>``"

msgid "``+``、``-``"
msgstr "``+``, ``-``"

msgid "``*``、``/``、``MOD`` / ``%``"
msgstr "``*``, ``/``, ``MOD`` / ``%``"

msgid "一元 ``+``、``-``、``NOT`` / ``~`` 和括号"
msgstr "Unary ``+``, ``-``, ``NOT`` / ``~``, and parentheses"

msgid ""
"``rol(值,位数)``、``ror(值,位数)`` 在选定字长内循环移位。位数也按所选进制 解释，必须小于字长。``^`` "
"在此模式表示异或，在科学模式表示乘方。"
msgstr ""
"``rol(值,位数)`` and ``ror(值,位数)`` rotate within the selected word size. The "
"count also uses the selected base and must be smaller than the word size. "
"Here ``^`` means XOR; in Scientific mode it means exponentiation."

msgid ""
"算术使用所选字长的模运算，截断时给出提示；不合法的字面量会报告超范围， 而不会静默截断。除法取整数商。有符号模式按补码解释十进制显示、除法、取余 "
"和右移；HEX/OCT/BIN 始终显示位模式。计算后的值在切换进制/符号模式时保留 位模式，缩短字长保留低位。未计算的输入按新的设置重新解析。"
msgstr ""
"Arithmetic is modulo the selected word size, with a truncation notice. "
"Invalid literals report out-of-range errors rather than silent truncation. "
"Division returns an integer quotient. Signed mode uses two's complement for "
"decimal display, division, remainder, and right shifts; HEX/OCT/BIN always "
"display bit patterns. Evaluated values retain their bit pattern when "
"base/signedness changes; reducing word size keeps low bits. Unevaluated "
"input is reparsed under the new settings."

msgid "位编辑器从左至右为高位到低位，每行 16 位，禁用超出当前字长的按钮。"
msgstr ""
"The bit editor runs from high bits on the left to low bits on the right, 16 "
"bits per row; buttons beyond the current word size are disabled."

msgid "单位与日历约定"
msgstr "Unit and Calendar Conventions"

msgid "换算类别包括长度、面积、体积与容量、质量、温度、时间、速度、加速度、角度、 压力、能量、功率、力、频率、数据存储、数据传输速率、密度和力矩。"
msgstr ""
"Conversion categories include length, area, volume/capacity, mass, "
"temperature, time, speed, acceleration, angle, pressure, energy, power, "
"force, frequency, data storage, data transfer rate, density, and torque."

msgid ""
"常数参考 `NIST SP 811 "
"<https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/Legacy/SP/nistspecialpublication811e2008.pdf>`_"
" 与 `NIST 二进制前缀说明 <https://physics.nist.gov/cuu/Units/binary.html>`_。 电子伏特使用 "
"`2018 年国际计量大会决议中的基本电荷精确值 "
"<https://www.bipm.org/en/committees/cg/cgpm/26-2018/resolution-1>`_： ``1 eV "
"= 1.602176634 × 10^-19 J``。 英尺使用国际英尺；容量明确区分美制液体单位和英制单位；卡路里使用热化学 定义，BTU 使用 IT"
" 定义。MB/GB 为十进制，MiB/GiB 为二进制，字节为 8 比特。 儒略年固定为 365.25 日，不等于任意公历年长度。温度转换包含零点偏移，"
" 拒绝低于绝对零度的数值。换算使用浮点计算，极端数值可能超出范围。 面积、容量、质量、频率、数据大小、传输速率和密度不接受负数；长度、时间、 "
"速度、加速度、角度、压力、能量、功率、力和力矩允许有符号数值。"
msgstr ""
"Constants reference `NIST SP 811 "
"<https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/Legacy/SP/nistspecialpublication811e2008.pdf>`_"
" and the `NIST binary prefix guide "
"<https://physics.nist.gov/cuu/Units/binary.html>`_. Electronvolts use the "
"`exact elementary charge in the 2018 CGPM resolution "
"<https://www.bipm.org/en/committees/cg/cgpm/26-2018/resolution-1>`_: ``1 eV "
"= 1.602176634 × 10^-19 J``. Feet use the international foot; capacity "
"distinguishes US liquid and imperial units; calories use the thermochemical "
"definition and BTU the IT definition. MB/GB are decimal, MiB/GiB binary, and"
" a byte is 8 bits. A Julian year is fixed at 365.25 days and is not the "
"length of an arbitrary Gregorian year. Temperature conversion includes zero-"
"point offsets and rejects values below absolute zero. Conversion uses "
"floating-point arithmetic; extreme values can overflow. Area, capacity, "
"mass, frequency, data size, transfer rate, and density reject negative "
"values; length, time, speed, acceleration, angle, pressure, energy, power, "
"force, and torque allow signed values."

msgid ""
"日期接受 ``YYYY-MM-DD``，支持 0001 至 9999 年。日期差为“结束减起始”， "
"不含结束日；逆序日期得到负数。工作日仅排除周六、周日，不考虑法定节假日。 增加天数使用公历整日运算，不依赖时区的夏令时转换。统计中的样本方差和 "
"样本标准差在只有一个数时显示“不适用”。"
msgstr ""
"Dates use ``YYYY-MM-DD`` and support years 0001–9999. Differences are end "
"minus start, excluding the end date; reversed dates produce negative values."
" Workdays exclude only Saturdays and Sundays, not public holidays. Adding "
"days uses whole Gregorian days independently of time-zone daylight-saving "
"transitions. Sample variance and standard deviation show Not Applicable when"
" statistics contain only one value."

msgid "快捷键"
msgstr "Keyboard Shortcuts"

msgid ""
"Ctrl+1 至 Ctrl+6 切换模式；Enter 计算，统计多行输入用 Ctrl+Enter； Esc 清空当前模式输入，Ctrl+Shift+C "
"复制结果。"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+1 through Ctrl+6 switches modes; Enter evaluates, or Ctrl+Enter in "
"multiline statistics input. Esc clears the current mode's input; "
"Ctrl+Shift+C copies the result."
